"view.agepointinput.help"              = "The Age Point (Huber method) starts at the Ascendant at birth and moves linearly through the 12 houses in a 72-year cycle, spending 6 years in each house.\n\nSelect 'Positions for Event' to see where the Age Point was at a specific event, together with aspects and midpoints to the radix.\n\nSelect 'Overview' to see the Age Point position for each year from 0 to 71 and beyond to 120.\n\nChoose the house system to use for the calculation. Koch is the default used by the Huber school.\n\nClick 'Calculate' to see the results.";

